+      "statement": "Focused tests reproduce the candidate-scoped pin bug and the mixed-base scale recovery, prove append-only successful correction, and attack wrong target, drift, changed paths or bytes, duplicate correction, malformed event, and correction after approval or rejection."
+    }
+  ]
+}
